<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.48 vs   4.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.34 vs   7.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.76 vs   7.35</p>
<p> Sales		   31.36 vs  24.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.81 vs  20.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.07 vs  33.61</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.47 vs  26.69</p>
<p> Sales		  178.68 vs 138.00</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu Zywiec SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
